{"3752160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drawn to Drift", "steam_appid": 3752160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you feel the call of the void? Are you <strong>drawn </strong>to <strong>drift</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you came to the right place. <strong>But be careful!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Braking and turning are especially challenging in space. Without <strong>friction</strong>, only those who master control over their ship can avoid all obstacles and reach the finish line in time - or at all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/0ccb036fe52fe32166940bb7fa7d4037.poster.avif?t=1775052017\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/0ccb036fe52fe32166940bb7fa7d4037.webm?t=1775052017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/0ccb036fe52fe32166940bb7fa7d4037.mp4?t=1775052017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SINGLEPLAYER</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the <strong>campaign</strong> and unlock <strong>stars</strong>, colorful <strong>titles</strong> and prestigious <strong>skins</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drift</strong> on endless <strong>community</strong> tracks or <strong>draw</strong> one yourself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against <strong>ghosts </strong>of past legends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your <strong>ship</strong> and <strong>tag</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p cla