><strong>Draw</strong> custom tracks in the powerful track <strong>editor</strong> and become the most <strong>famous</strong> <strong>creator</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Tools:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walls</strong> - Normal, Ice, Bounce, Death, ..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zones</strong> - Slow Motion, No Thrust, No Turn, Wind, Damp, Speed Lock, ..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obstacles</strong> - Black Hole, Laser, Mine, Missile Turret, Ghost Mirror, ..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specials</strong> - Portal, Launcher, Size Changer, Phasing, ..</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/cd2a6c1b84c92dc11ef909b79869f3a9.poster.avif?t=1775052017\" width=1076 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/cd2a6c1b84c92dc11ef909b79869f3a9.webm?t=1775052017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752160/extras/cd2a6c1b84c92dc11ef909b79869f3a9.mp4?t=1775052017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNLOCK &amp; CUSTOMIZE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ <strong>Ships</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ <strong>Colors</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ <strong>Trails</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ <strong>Titles</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you feel the call of the void? Are you <strong>drawn </strong>to <strong>drift</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you came to the right place. <strong>But be careful!</strong>